      {
        "number": 13,
        "internalPageId": 14,
        "title": "Children Chit chat! You know what? I am going to become a YouTuber when I get older. No way! It is better to work as a trader. I am going to be one of the best traders ever. Well, that too. Hey, how about VR developer? Joe’s brother is going to start working at a VR company as a developer. Amazing! When is he going to start working there? I guess on July, but I am going to ask Joe to confirm. Do you think he is going to get free demos to try? I hope he does! So maybe, we are going to be able to play with Joe. OMG! If that is true, we are going to be the luckiest kids on the block. Totally! I am going to ask Joe now. Let’s go!",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Children Chit chat! You know what? I am going to become a YouTuber when I get older. No way! It is better to work as a trader. I am going to be one of the best traders ever. Well, that too. Hey, how about VR developer? Joe’s brother is going to start working at a VR company as a developer. Amazing! When is he going to start working there? I guess on July, but I am going to ask Joe to confirm. Do you think he is going to get free demos to try? I hope he does! So maybe, we are going to be able to play with Joe. OMG! If that is true, we are going to be the luckiest kids on the block. Totally! I am going to ask Joe now. Let’s go!",
          "C. Read the following dialogue and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the dialogue aloud with your teacher.",
          "1. Kid number 1 wants to be a YouTuber. (T) (F) 2. The other kid is going to become a YouTuber too. (T) (F) 3. Joe is going to work as a VR developer. (T) (F) 4. Joe’s brother is going to start in February. (T) (F)",
          "5. Joe’s brother is going to get free demos. (T) (F) 6. They are going to play with Joe if his brother gets demos. (T) (F) 7. They are not going to be the luckiest kids from the block. (T) (F) 8. They are going to ask Joe about it now. (T) (F)"
        ],
